                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have backed and purchased a few beta games such as Racing Glider but this one is very far away from being in beta.\n\nWhen you start the game you cannot see any controls as it cuts off the top of the play area and it opens in a window which cannot be resized.\n\nThere are no options, nothing to show you what keys to press and is this only a VR title, the game does not make this clear at all.\n\nI will stick with the title to support the developers (Good Luck) but you should not have released this game now as in this state you will rightly receive negative reviews of which I cannot fault them for.\n\nPlease release just a quick NotePad update, firstly for the keys and secondly a road map would be helpful.\n\nYou should pull this game till you are further down the road, I expect to have at least a splash screen at the start of the game with keys.\n\nIt has been experience from other beta games that if you intend to please this now (September 2020) then don't expect a meaningful update for a playable game till at least March/August 2021.",
